``` Lab 05 - SIEM version of the log-brute-force-detector rules: BRUTE_FORCE and PASSWORD_SPRAY per source IP per minute. ```
index=linux sourcetype=linux_secure ("Failed password" OR "Failed keyboard-interactive")
| rex "Failed \S+ for (invalid user )?(?<user>\S+) from (?<src_ip>\S+) port"
| bin _time span=1m
| stats count as failures dc(user) as distinct_users values(user) as users by _time host src_ip
| eval rule=case(distinct_users>=5, "PASSWORD_SPRAY", failures>=5, "BRUTE_FORCE")
| where isnotnull(rule)
